# Cloud Build needs only the worker source and its build configuration.
*
!workers/
!workers/**
# Keep nested local data and credentials out even if added under workers later.
**/node_modules/
**/.env*
**/.git/
**/.data/
**/.next*/
**/artifacts/
**/candidate-output/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*credentials*.json
**/*service-account*.json

# Also exclude non-dot environment bundles placed below the source tree.
**/*.env
**/*.env.*
